{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08637","headline":"登邯郸洪波台置酒观发兵 · 李白","name":"登邯郸洪波台置酒观发兵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我把两赤羽，来游燕赵间。\n天狼正可射，感激无时闲。\n观兵洪波台，倚劒望玉关。\n请缨不系越，且向燕然山。\n风引龙虎旗，歌钟昔追攀。\n击筑落高月，投壶破愁颜。\n遥知百战胜，定扫鬼方还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08637.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08637","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}